  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nabosi kūng'wima ngūnda Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosha ūmò walīho, lina lyakwe Nabosi; walī na ngūnda gwa mizabibu īpandī lya Yezileeli, bbihī nī likūlū lya ntemi wa Samalia ū Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ūng'wīla ū Nabosi, “Ninhage ū ngūnda gwako gwa mizabibu, nayūlīma moi makūbī īkī gūlī bbihī n'ikūlū lyane; nakūkwinha ngūnda gūngī gwawiza kūtinda. Nūūlū nakūgūlīle ūlū ūlīzunya, nakwinhe īsho shiigeleelilwe ū mpango gwaho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Nabosi ūshosha, “Ū nene ngilo ū kūkwinha bebe ū wingīji wa bataale bane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ūdudubala no, ūja ī kaya wadakaga na kadakīle kangī nako nīyo; nguno ū Nabosi wa Yezileeli akang'wīla, “Natūdūla ū kūkwinha ū wingīji wa bakūlūgenji baane.” Ūūkashikīla kwiponya ha būlīīlī wakwe ūlaala, wikina ūlema nū kūlya ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nke wakwe ū Yezebeli wingīla moi kūnola; ūmūja, “Ni kinehe wikinaga gīko shi? Nibūlī walemaga ū kūlya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshosha, “Angū ū Nabosi wa Yezileeli shi; naalī nang'wīla, ‘Bebe nijingījage ū ngūnda gwako gwa mizabibu, nūūlū tūkaabane naheene nakwinhe ngūnda gwa mizabibu gūngī ūlū ūlītogwa.’ Alīyo walemaga gete alīhaya, ‘Natīko kūkwinha ū ngūnda gwane gwa mizabibu!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wiboneeji bo ng'wa Yezebeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nke wakwe ū Yezebeli ūng'wīla, “Nang'ho hū ūlī ntemi wa Isilaelilūūlū ī gīko? Būūkaga ūlye, ūzalabane na kūzalabana; nakūkwinha ū ngūnda go ng'wa Nabosi wa Yezileeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wandīka nyalūba mu lina lya ng'wa Ahabu, ūjitūūlīla nū lūmeng'ho ūlo watūmamīlaga ū Ahabu; hūna ūjitūma ū kū banamhala na a batongeeji ba kū nzengo ūyo wikalaga ū Nabosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nyalūba jenījo wandīka alīhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Balagījagi a banhū kwiza kū lūgiiko, nīyo mubawīle kūfunga ū lūshikū lwenūlo; hanuma ū Nabosi muntūūle h'ipandī aho banhū bose badūgije kūmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna mukūtūūla bakaanīji babīlī balomolomo, mubawīle bankaanīle ū Nabosi gīkī wandūkagūlile ū Mulungu, nū ntemi. Na lūūlū afunyiwe hanze muje mukamponde mawe ache.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana a banamhala na a batongeeji ba mu nzengo ūyo wikalaga ū Nabosi bīīta gīt'ūmo bakalagīīlīlwa nū Yezebeli, ūmo akandīkīla ū mu nyalūba ījo akabatwaalīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbalagīja a banhū kwiza kū lūgiiko, būbawīla nū gwa kūfunga ū lūshikū lwenūlo; hanuma ū Nabosi būntūūla h'ipandī lya kūbonwa na banhū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bakaanīji babīlī balomolomo bigasha bilolelile nang'hwe ū Nabosi, būfunya būkaanīji wa būlomolomo ū kū banhū balīhaya, “Ū Nabosi wandūkagūlile ū Mulungu nū ntemi.” Hūna būmfunya hanze ya nzengo būūkamponda mawe ūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya kūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo, būtwala nhūng'wa ū kūlī Yezebeli balīhaya, “Ū Nabosi wapondilwe mawe wachile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yezebeli aho wigwa gīkī ū Nabosi wapondilwe mawe ūcha, ūng'wīla ū Ahabu, “Būūkaga lūūlū ūje ūkagūdiime ū ngūnda gwa mizabibu ūyo Nabosi muna Yezileeli walī walema ū kūkūjingīja. Ī haha atī mpanga, wachiile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu aho wigwa gīkī ū Nabosi wachile, ūbūūka ng'hana, ūja kūgūdima ū ngūnda gwa mizabibu ūyo gwalī go ng'wa Nabosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya kūtūng'wa kūlī Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Eliya ū muna Tishibe; gūhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ū kūlī Ahabu ū ntemi wa Isilaeli; ū wei nūūlū īkī akikalaga Samalia, ī haha ūkūnsangīla mu ngūnda gwa mizabibu go ng'wa Nabosi, wajile kūgūdima gūbize gwakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya, ‘Ū bebe, ūtabūlagile munhū hūna wīdima ī sabo yakwe gīkī ībize yako?’” Hanuma ng'wīlage, Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, “A h'ipandī īlo mvwa jazabangīlile mininga ga ng'wa Nabosi, na a gako jikūgazabangīlīla henaho; ee, a mininga gako gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ūng'wīla ū Eliya, “Bebe ng'wanishi wane, wanisanga hangī!” Nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Nakūsanga hangī ng'hana, nguno wijingije bebe ng'wenekīlī kūlwa kwīta mihayo yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Managa gīkī nakūkwenhela yabūbi; nakwīpyagūla gete ī kaya yako īshile ho; na a banhū ba ng'wa Ahabu, a bagosha nakūbayagaja pye a bose ū mu Isilaeli; ni babizage balī mu wiyaabī nūūlū mu būsese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī numba yako nakwīyīta ībize gītī ya ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, na ya ng'wa Baasha ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahiya; nguno wanisaayīkije no, na a Baisilaeli ūbenheleja kūhūba.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ya ng'wa Yezebeli, ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wene akūliiwa mvwa bbihī na ndugu ya Yezileeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Ahabu a ba kūchīla mu nzengo bakūliiwa mvwa, a ba kūchīla kū matogolo bakūgombagūlwa manoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Walī atīho munhū wa kūbiza gīt'ūmo walī Ahabu, ūyo walī wijinja wei ng'wenekīlī kūlwa kwīta mihayo yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, kūnū akūsamīlījiagwa nū nke wakwe ū Yezebeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo washimīzaga mu būhūganu būtaale no kūlwa kūlondeela shiikolile gīt'ūmo bītīlaga Baamoni, abo SEEBA walī wabapeeja būbīngīla a Baisilaeli.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgalūka kwa ng'wa Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
